<title>USA: EV Environmental wins sewer contract.</title>
<headline>EV Environmental wins sewer contract.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>EV Environmental Inc. said it and Atlanta's Parsons Engineering Science Inc had been selected by the Metropolitan Sewer District of Louisville and Jefferson County, Ky., to provide an alternative solids handling system at the MSD's main treatment plant.</p>
<p>EV Environmental Inc Chairman Michael R. Cox said that, although the final contract will take additional time to negotiate, he expects EV Environmental's portion will be the largest contract in the company's six-year history. Cox said the company's largest contract had been about $5 million.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
